                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Part III</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">section vii</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">Article 4</p>
                <p>No inhabitants of the territories of the former Austro-Hungarian Monarchy shall
                    be disturbed or molested either on account of his political attitude between
                    August 1st, 1914, and the date of the final recognition of sovereignty over
                    those territories or on account of the settlement of his nationality by virtue
                    of the present treaty.</p>
            </div>
